  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 3a975e36eca21da4383cab3d1f951b27, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - With the last stretch of road cleared, you drive forward, towards the city in
    the distance.
  - You have reached Astoria, and your journey is at its end.
  - The message of your good deeds has spread far and wide.
  - The people of Astoria welcome you as one of your own, and you finally live in
    peace.
  - The End.
  dialoguePortraits:
