  - {fileID: 8300000, guid: 9742e12447cdee742a54a9cc5875ff1b, type: 3}
  decisions: 000000000a000000000000000000000000000000
  altLinesOne:
  - However, word of your selfishness has spread to the people of Astoria
  - You are not allowed to live within the city, and you depart to once again roam
    the earth in search of shelter.
  - The End.
  altLinesTwo:
  - The tales of your various dealings are mixed; some good, some bad.
  - But in the end, the people of Astoria allow you to live there nonetheless.
  - The End.
